    "title": "Kitty Keep\u2122",
    "description": "Journey to the beach for a cat-filled offline tower defense (TD) adventure! Strategize with cute cat heroes, growing your castle to thwart invaders.\r\n\r\nLevel up unique cat heroes to turn the tide on sea creature enemies by using the power of claws, water, and sand!\r\n\r\nExperience a seamless fusion of idle and tower defense strategy, effortlessly earning rewards through Auto-battle!\r\n\r\nJoin the legion of cat commanders worldwide for a purr-fect mix of tower defense fun and tactics!",
